---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const faq = [
  ['What is the best villa in Santorini for families?', 'In my opinion, the villas at Canaves Epitome. Epitome has no age restrictions, which is rare for a true luxury hotel on Santorini, and its Five-Bedroom Villa (up to 14 guests) and Three-Bedroom Pool Villa (up to 7) give a family a private pool, a private garden and real space, with a full hotel staff behind them.'],
  ['What is the best villa in Greece for families with kids?', 'Of everything I&rsquo;ve seen across nine islands in the Cyclades, the Epitome villas are where I&rsquo;d send a family with young kids first. You get villa privacy without giving up the hotel: Omnia for dinner, the spa, the gardens and the gardens.'],
  ['Are children allowed at Canaves Epitome?', 'Yes. Epitome has no age restrictions, so children are welcome in the villas and everywhere on the property. Many of Santorini&rsquo;s luxury hotels are adults-only or built down steep caldera steps, so this matters more here than almost anywhere in Greece.'],
  ['How many people do the Epitome villas sleep?', 'The Five-Bedroom Villa sleeps up to 14 guests. The Three-Bedroom Pool Villa sleeps up to 7. For a bigger group, the two can be combined with suites, or the whole hotel can be bought out.'],
  ['How big is the Five-Bedroom Villa?', 'About 550 square meters (5,920 sq ft) inside across two levels, plus 450 square meters (4,844 sq ft) outside, with a private garden, a terrace with an open-air pool, a heated jacuzzi and an outdoor dining area facing the sea.'],
  ['What is the Three-Bedroom Pool Villa?', 'Epitome&rsquo;s Two-Bedroom Pool Villa combined with a Hideaway Pool Suite: about 170 square meters (1,830 sq ft) inside across two stories and 200 square meters (2,153 sq ft) outside, with a private garden, a pool terrace and sea views. It&rsquo;s the right size for one family, or two couples.'],
  ['Is Canaves Epitome on the caldera?', 'No. Epitome sits a short walk from Oia near Ammoudi Bay rather than on the caldera cliff. That&rsquo;s what gives it the space, the gardens and the sunset straight into the Aegean, and it&rsquo;s a big part of why it works so well for families.'],
  ['How much do the Epitome villas cost?', 'Rates vary a lot by season and length of stay, so ask me for your dates. I&rsquo;ll check both villas, and the rest of the Canaves collection if it makes more sense for your group.'],
  ['What about Canaves Sunday?', '<a href="/hotels/canaves-sunday-santorini.html">Canaves Sunday</a> is my pick when a large group wants a whole property to itself in the middle of Oia: a ten-bedroom villa plus eight suites. For a family who wants a villa with a full resort around it, I&rsquo;d choose Epitome.'],
];

const kv5 = [
  ['Bedrooms', '<b>5</b>, sleeping up to 14'],
  ['Inside', '550 m&sup2; (5,920 sq ft) across two levels'],
  ['Outside', '450 m&sup2; (4,844 sq ft): private garden, pool terrace, heated jacuzzi, outdoor dining'],
  ['Views', 'Sea view, toward the sunset'],
  ['Service', 'Twice-daily housekeeping, wine and fruit on arrival, full use of the hotel'],
];

const kv3 = [
  ['Bedrooms', '<b>3</b>, sleeping up to 7'],
  ['Layout', 'The Two-Bedroom Pool Villa combined with a Hideaway Pool Suite'],
  ['Inside', '170 m&sup2; (1,830 sq ft) across two stories'],
  ['Outside', '200 m&sup2; (2,153 sq ft): private garden and a terrace with an open-air pool'],
  ['Views', 'Sea view'],
];
---
<Layout
  canonical="canaves-epitome-villas-santorini.html"
  title="Canaves Epitome Villas: The Best Family Villa in Santorini | Suites With Keith"
  description="Keith's firsthand pick for the best family villa in Santorini: the Five-Bedroom Villa (sleeps 14) and Three-Bedroom Pool Villa (sleeps 7) at Canaves Epitome, with private pools, gardens, no age restrictions and the best sunset in Greece."
  preload="/images/hotels/epitome-villas/family-arch-sunset.jpg"
  ctaLabel="Ask about the villas"
>

<script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify({
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: faq.map(([q, a]) => ({ '@type': 'Question', name: q.replace(/&rsquo;/g, '’'), acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: a.replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').replace(/&rsquo;/g, '’') } })),
})} />

<header class="hero" style="min-height:min(78svh,720px);">
  <img class="hero-img" src="/images/hotels/epitome-villas/family-arch-sunset.jpg" alt="A family walking through a volcanic-stone arch toward their private villa terrace and pool at sunset, Canaves Epitome, Santorini" width="1510" height="927" fetchpriority="high" />
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Santorini &middot; Stayed at Epitome</p>
    <h1 class="display-xl" style="margin-top:18px;">The Best Family Villa in Santorini</h1>
    <p class="sub">The Five-Bedroom and Three-Bedroom Pool Villas at Canaves Epitome: private pools and gardens, no age restrictions, and a real sunset into the Aegean.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a class="btn" href="#inquire" data-gtag-label="start_planning" data-gtag-location="hero">Ask about the villas</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost on-shadow" href="/hotels/canaves-epitome-santorini.html" style="border-color:rgba(242,239,230,.4); color:var(--band-ink);">Read my Epitome review</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:860px;">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="deck" style="max-width:44ch;">Epitome is my favorite hotel across nine islands in the Cyclades, and its villas are the best place I know in Santorini for a family.</p>
      <p class="body-2" style="margin-top:20px; max-width:62ch;">Here&rsquo;s the problem with Santorini and kids: most of the top hotels are adults-only, or built into the caldera cliff with a lot of steps. Epitome has no age restrictions, and it sits a short walk from Oia near Ammoudi Bay, behind volcanic-rock walls and landscaped gardens. It feels like a world away from the crowds in Oia.</p>
      <p class="body-2" style="margin-top:14px; max-width:62ch;">The two villas give a family what a suite can&rsquo;t: room to spread out, your own pool, a private garden for the kids to run around in, and a terrace for dinner while they swim. You still have the whole hotel around you, from breakfast to the spa to Omnia, which was the best hotel restaurant I ate at across the entire trip.</p>
      <p class="body-2" style="margin-top:14px; max-width:62ch;">And then there&rsquo;s the sunset. Because you&rsquo;re not tucked into the caldera bowl, you watch an actual sunset into the Aegean rather than the sun disappearing behind the cliff. It&rsquo;s the best sunset in Greece, in my opinion, and you get it from your own terrace.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="photos reveal">
      <figure><img src="/images/hotels/epitome-villas/kids-private-pool.jpg" alt="Kids swimming in a private villa pool overlooking the sea at Canaves Epitome, Santorini" width="1510" height="1960" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>A private pool, and the Aegean behind it</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/hotels/epitome-villas/villa-pool-lounge.jpg" alt="Volcanic-stone arches, a pool and a sunken lounge at a Canaves Epitome villa in Santorini" width="1007" height="1060" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Volcanic stone, water everywhere</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container villa-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow" style="display:block; margin-bottom:14px;">For the whole family</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">The Five-Bedroom Villa</h2>
      <p class="body-2" style="margin-top:18px; max-width:52ch;">Epitome&rsquo;s most exclusive stay, and the one I&rsquo;d book for a multigenerational trip or two families traveling together. Bright, light-filled interiors spread over two levels, opening onto a private garden, a pool terrace, a heated jacuzzi and an outdoor area for sundowners and long dinners. It sleeps up to 14, with access to everything the hotel offers.</p>
      <dl class="kv" style="margin-top:24px;">
        {kv5.map(([k, v]) => <div class="kv-row"><dt set:html={k} /><dd set:html={v} /></div>)}
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow" style="display:block; margin-bottom:14px;">For one family</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">The Three-Bedroom Pool Villa</h2>
      <p class="body-2" style="margin-top:18px; max-width:52ch;">Epitome&rsquo;s Two-Bedroom Pool Villa combined with a Hideaway Pool Suite, so you get a private haven over two stories with a garden and an open-air pool. The two-bedroom suites were already the star of my stay, so this is the version I&rsquo;d book for parents with two or three kids.</p>
      <dl class="kv" style="margin-top:24px;">
        {kv3.map(([k, v]) => <div class="kv-row"><dt set:html={k} /><dd set:html={v} /></div>)}
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section band on-shadow">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:860px;">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal" style="display:block; margin-bottom:16px;">Why it works for kids</span>
    <h2 class="display-l reveal">Villa privacy, with a resort around it</h2>
    <ul class="why reveal">
      <li><b>No age restrictions.</b> Rare for a luxury hotel on Santorini, and the reason I start every family conversation here.</li>
      <li><b>Space and gardens.</b> Off the caldera, so you have lawns, landscaping and room to move instead of cliffside steps.</li>
      <li><b>Your own pool.</b> Both villas have a private open-air pool on the terrace, and the Five-Bedroom adds a heated jacuzzi.</li>
      <li><b>The whole Canaves ecosystem.</b> An easy shuttle connects you to the other Canaves properties and their restaurants and spas.</li>
      <li><b>Oia without the crowds.</b> A short walk into town when you want it, and quiet when you come back.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:860px;">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Booking through me</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">Fora perks, and someone who knows Epitome</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="body-2 reveal" style="max-width:62ch;">I&rsquo;ve stayed at Epitome and I know the Canaves team, so I&rsquo;ll match you to the right villa for your group, time it to the right season and set everything up before you arrive. As a Fora advisor with a preferred partnership at Canaves, my clients receive Fora perks on eligible stays, like daily breakfast and a hotel credit, and rates are identical to booking direct.</p>
    <dl class="kv reveal" style="margin-top:24px;">
      <div class="kv-row"><dt>I arrange</dt><dd>Private transfers from the airport or port, and <a href="/private-boat-transfers.html">private boats</a> to Folegandros, Milos or Ios instead of the ferry</dd></div>
      <div class="kv-row"><dt>On the island</dt><dd>A private caldera sunset cruise, dinner at Omnia and the rest of your <a href="/santorini.html">Santorini</a> plan</dd></div>
      <div class="kv-row"><dt>Bigger group?</dt><dd>Full-property buyouts are available at Epitome, or see <a href="/hotels/canaves-sunday-santorini.html">Canaves Sunday</a> and my <a href="/santorini-weddings.html">Santorini weddings page</a></dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Before you ask</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">The questions I get</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq reveal">
      {faq.map(([q, a]) => (
        <details>
          <summary set:html={q} />
          <p class="body-2" set:html={a} />
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section inquire band on-shadow" id="inquire" style="scroll-margin-top:70px;">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal" style="display:block; margin-bottom:16px;">The Epitome Villas</span>
    <h2 class="display-l reveal">When are you thinking?</h2>
    <p class="deck reveal" style="margin:18px auto 0; max-width:44ch;">Tell me your dates, who&rsquo;s coming and the kids&rsquo; ages. I&rsquo;ll check both villas and plan the rest of Greece around them.</p>
    <form class="inquire-form reveal" action="https://formspree.io/f/mjgnadov" method="POST">
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Canaves Epitome villa inquiry" />
      <input type="hidden" name="hotel" value="Canaves Epitome Villas, Santorini" />
      <input type="hidden" name="page" value="canaves-epitome-villas-santorini" />
      <input type="text" name="_gotcha" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
      <div class="step1">
        <label for="q-when" style="color:var(--band-ash);">When are you thinking?</label>
        <input id="q-when" type="text" name="travel_dates" placeholder="July 2027 · 5 nights · 2 families" required autocomplete="off" />
      </div>
      <div class="step2">
        <label for="q-name" style="color:var(--band-ash);">And where do I send the plan?</label>
        <input id="q-name" type="text" name="name" placeholder="Name" required autocomplete="name" />
        <input id="q-email" type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required autocomplete="email" />
        <label for="q-details" style="margin-top:2px; color:var(--band-ash);">Anything else? Kids&rsquo; ages, occasion, the rest of the trip (optional)</label>
        <input id="q-details" type="text" name="details" placeholder="Kids 6, 9 and 12 · then Paros and Athens" autocomplete="off" />
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn" data-gtag-label="villa_inquiry_send" data-gtag-location="villa_cta">Send</button>
      <p class="note" style="color:var(--band-ash);">Traveling within the next 30 days? You&rsquo;ll hear from me today.</p>
      <p class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .villa-grid { display: grid; gap: 64px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; align-items: start; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .villa-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; } }
  .villa-grid > * { min-width: 0; }
  .photos img { aspect-ratio: 4/5; }
  .why { margin-top: 24px; padding-left: 1.1em; max-width: 62ch; }
  .why li { margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .faq details { border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); padding: 18px 0; }
  .faq details:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
  .faq summary { cursor: pointer; font-family: var(--display); font-size: 1.2rem; list-style: none; position: relative; padding-right: 28px; }
  .faq summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .faq summary::after { content: "+"; position: absolute; right: 0; top: 0; color: var(--brass); font-family: var(--body); }
  .faq details[open] summary::after { content: "\2013"; }
  .faq details p { margin-top: 12px; max-width: 62ch; }
</style>
